/**
 * GOOGLE DOCS — DYNAMIC PLACEHOLDER SUBSTITUTION
 *
 * Configuration is maintained centrally in PLACEHOLDER_CONFIG.
 * The HTML form, validation, and substitution logic are generated
 * dynamically from this configuration.
 */

